    "media:imagetext": "British\nalrways\nHUGHES\nAIRWEST\nand\nGolden Gateway Service\nLondon to Western USA\nvia San Francisco\nBA287 Daily* 747\ndeparts London 2:30 pm\narrives San Francisco 5:30 pm.\nDaily connections by Hughes Airwest from\nSan Francisco to: Arizona, California and Oregon.\nTo\nChico\nEureka/ Arcata\nKlamath Falls\nRedding\nRedmond\nSacramento\nTucson\nDep. SFO Arr.\nCal. 7:05 pm\n7:45 pm\nCal. 7:50 pm\n8:45 pm\nOre.\n7:05 pm\n8:37 pm\nCal.\n7:40 pm\n8:26 pm\n..Ore. 7:05 pm\n9:32 pm\n..Cal. 8:10 pm\n8:44 pm\nAriz. 7:35 pm\n10:16 pm\nRW FIt. No.\n934\n942\n934\n883\n934\n8\n727\nBritish Airways flies to London from over 120\ncities in Britain, Europe and beyond.\nFor reservations and information in U.K. telephone\nLondon (01)370-5411, Glasgow (041)332-9666,\nManchester (061)228-6311.\n*October 1 - 28 not Tuesdays and Wednesdays\nOctober 29 - April 28, 1979 not Mondays, Wednesdays and Fridays.",
